%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a stroke's outline fills as the stroke, with butt caps.
% Page 1 fills the outline strokepath leaves of an open two-segment
% path 30 wide with butt caps (PLRM3 §8.2 strokepath, setlinecap);
% page 2 strokes the same path. The first page's IR carries one fill
% of closed subpaths and no stroke; both pages paint the same area.
/path { 120 150 moveto 360 220 lineto 220 500 lineto } def
30 setlinewidth 0 setlinecap
path strokepath fill
showpage
30 setlinewidth 0 setlinecap
path stroke
showpage
